# Phase

Fundamental phase skeleton for a process family.

◇

attributes:
    - key: num
      name: Num
      details: Order of this phase within the family.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: name
      name: Name
      details: Unique among phases of the same family.
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING
    - key: description
      name: Description
      details: Defaults to empty when omitted.
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING
